Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.23,0:00:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? You want to know what \Nthe courtesans' do on their days off?{Huh? You want to ask about how\Nthe courtesans' days off are?}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.78,0:00:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.07,0:00:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Recently they went to the beach and I tagged along.{I recently went to the beach\N with all of the courtesans.}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.77,0:00:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I got a nice suntan, {well suntanned}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.35,0:00:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,but I ended up with tanlines\Nmuch to my embarrassment.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.59,0:00:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh!?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.77,0:00:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to see what I looked like? {how}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.00,0:00:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Uhh...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.50,0:00:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's embarrassing, but I'll make an exception. {this an}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.21,0:00:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I carelessly ended up sleeping in my bathing suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.66,0:00:55.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It left me with very visible\Ntanlines just as you can see.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.97,0:00:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to know my vital statistics?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.53,0:00:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,U-{\alpha&HFF&}Umm...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.86,0:01:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,U-Umm...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.04,0:01:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm 88-56-83 centimeters from top to bottom.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.01,0:01:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Uhh... This is embarrassing!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.78,0:01:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I have the hips for easy childbirth? \N{\alpha&HFF&}Y-You wouldn't mind marrying me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.24,0:01:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I have the hips for easy childbirth? \NY-{\alpha&HFF&}You wouldn't mind marrying me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.62,0:01:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I have the hips for easy childbirth? \NY-You wouldn't mind marrying me?{so you want to marry me?}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.17,0:01:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.11,0:01:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Please be my first customer when\NI become a full-fledged courtesan.
Dialogue: 3,0:01:27.76,0:01:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the Courtesans Palace of Mystics!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.67,0:01:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I-{\alpha&HFF&}It's a pleasure to meet you, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.40,0:01:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I-It's a pleasure to meet you, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.10,0:01:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a canid demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.57,0:01:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,M-{\alpha&HFF&}My name is Megumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.94,0:01:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,M-My name is Megumi.
